//@version=6
// Liveness probe for the fork's P5 drawdown / P&L-percent statistics (card #151).
//
// The seven P5 fields (unrealized_max_drawdown(+%), real_max_drawdown(+%),
// total/realized/unrealized_pnl_percent) are computed per bar inside the sim
// position's bar finalisation and surfaced only through the strategy statistics --
// no Pine member reads them, so a rebase can drop the accumulation without any
// existing test noticing. This probe builds the one scenario that gives every
// field a non-zero, hand-computable value and the test beside it reads them from
// the statistics object and from the position itself:
//
//   bars 0-2 flat at 100; L1 entered on bar 2 (fills bar 3 open at 100)
//   bar 3-4 rise to 103; L1 closed on bar 4 (fills bar 5 open at 103): realized +3
//   L2 entered on bar 5 (fills bar 6 open at 100)
//   bar 6: low 90, close 95   -> open loss 5 (real DD 5 = 5% of the 100 entry cost),
//                                worst intrabar equity 100003 - 10 (unrealized DD 10)
//   bar 7: low 92, close 96   -> smaller excursion: neither maximum may move
//   the run ENDS with L2 open (open P&L -4), so the unrealized fields are non-zero
//
// Commission is 0 so every value is exact. SIM mode only: in broker mode the
// drawdown fields are declared but not computed, by design.
strategy("P5 drawdown liveness", initial_capital = 100000,
         default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1,
         commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0)

if bar_index == 2
    strategy.entry("L1", strategy.long)
if bar_index == 4
    strategy.close("L1")
if bar_index == 5
    strategy.entry("L2", strategy.long)

plot(strategy.position_size, "position_size")
plot(strategy.openprofit, "openprofit")
plot(strategy.netprofit, "netprofit")
